15	// (auditLines()). Data is arranged via resetAndSeed; the pay flow is driven through the UI.
16	// Seed honours invoices: { id, projectId, amount, status }.
17	//
18	// The paid label is asserted case-insensitively (/^paid$/i) so the test tolerates whichever casing
19	// the feature renders (Paid / PAID / paid). The audit amount is matched with an optional trailing
20	// ".00" so a plain or two-decimal rendering both pass. Amounts are chosen as distinct whole numbers
21	// so no value is a substring of another.
